#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:76
msgid "Email server (listmonk)"
msgstr "Serveur de courriel (listmonk)"

#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:77
msgid ""
"Point Town Hall at your listmonk server. Which emails are sent, and with "
"which templates, is set in Communication &gt; Email. Without a server, "
"emails are printed in the server console instead (useful for testing)."
msgstr ""
"Indiquez à Town Hall votre serveur listmonk. Les e-mails envoyés, et leurs "
"modèles, se définissent dans Communication &gt; E-mail. Sans serveur, les e-"
"mails sont affichés dans la console du serveur (utile pour les tests)."

#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:84
msgid "LISTMONK_URL is set on the server and is used while this is empty."
msgstr ""
"LISTMONK_URL est défini sur le serveur et est utilisé tant que ce champ est "
"vide."

#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:86
msgid "How to connect listmonk"
msgstr "Comment connecter listmonk"

#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:87
msgid ""
"In listmonk, open Admin > Users, create an API user with a role that can "
"manage subscribers, lists, templates and campaigns and send transactional "
"messages, and paste its name and token above."
msgstr ""
"Dans listmonk, ouvrez Admin > Users, créez un utilisateur API avec un rôle "
"pouvant gérer les abonnés, les listes, les modèles et les campagnes et "
"envoyer des messages transactionnels, puis collez son nom et son jeton ci-"
"dessus."

#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:88
msgid ""
"Delivery (SMTP, Amazon SES, Postmark...) is configured in listmonk under "
"Settings > SMTP."
msgstr ""
"La livraison (SMTP, Amazon SES, Postmark...) se configure dans listmonk sous "
"Settings > SMTP."

#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:93
msgid "Send test email"
msgstr "Envoyer un e-mail de test"

#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:95
msgid "your account email"
msgstr "l’adresse e-mail de votre compte"

